he vertices of the new housing complex.\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        ${A}^{′}(-9,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        $4$                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$)$\n$\\,$\n${B}^{′}($\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        $-21$                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$,14)$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                                \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        ${C}^{